For AfriEstate, I would use Booking.com's proven search → filter → compare → trust → transact architecture, but redesign the entire experience around African real estate discovery, renting, buying and investing.

The objective should be:
AfriEstate — Africa's property marketplace for real people, real assets and real investment opportunities.

Below is the complete UI/UX blueprint.
AfriEstate — Deep UI/UX Design System














