37. The Strategic Difference
The biggest opportunity is not to build "Booking.com for property."

Build:
Booking.com + Zillow + Airbnb + a property investment terminal — designed specifically for Africa.

The product should have three layers:
Layer 1 — Marketplace
Find property

Buy • Rent • Sell
Layer 2 — Intelligence
Understand property

Prices • neighbourhoods • yields • market trends • AI recommendations
Layer 3 — Financial infrastructure
Invest in property

REITs • developments • fractional opportunities • portfolio management • returns

That combination would make AfriEstate substantially more ambitious than a conventional African property listing portal.

If you want this translated directly into a production-ready UI specification, the next logical artifact is a screen-by-screen system covering Homepage → Search → Filters → Property Detail → Map → Compare → Rent Application → Buy/OFFER → Investment → Wallet/Portfolio → Agent Dashboard → Developer Dashboard → Admin Command Center, with exact components, states, interactions, responsive behavior and design tokens.